(build.sha256), so a new build of the same version is offered; a portal installed while one runs offers a restart.
installed_copy() named no folder in this layout, so neither was offered. The move of the state of a portal up to
1.0.0 out of the program folder is gone (owner: no backward compatibility). Board Test's tag is recorded, its Desktop
icon follows --no-desktop-shortcut, and the menu entry has the full desktop entry.

Added. The suite is Beta (STAGE).

Fixed. RENAMED names the apps renamed on 15-11-2026 (bazzite: board, btpair: bluetooth), so an app installed under
its old key is recorded under its new one, its tag renamed with it.

Fixed. The last of the media cards: the Media category, its hint and portal/images/categories/media.webp are gone;
the four categories are its twin's.

Fixed. apps.toml is read as in its twin (tag, sha256, withdrawn and board_change checked with their
own messages; board_change's white space collapsed, as the wiki's box compares it); the desktop icons are every
ps5-*.desktop menu entry, so a new app is never left out; the restart after the portal's own update starts from the
launcher's folder; the weather texts say it is the status' third line; BigTile.icon_scale, never set, is gone.

Fixed. requirements-dev.txt takes pytest>=8 like every folder; .gitignore as the other folders'.

Added. The twin's portal tests for the shared code (sources, portal update, status, weather, keyboard,
touchpad, sysinfo, the installed copy), adapted to this suite's apps.

